# Secrets. The negation must follow the patterns it negates, or it is ignored.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Slack CLI machine state: which app id is installed where, and its caches.
# Nothing in the repository reads it, and re-linking on another machine is one
# command. The manifest — the part that is a decision — is committed.
.slack/apps*.json
.slack/cache/
